# Normalize line endings for Go sources so the gofmt gate in CI is stable
# across self-hosted runners (Windows PowerShell/CRLF checkouts would otherwise
# make every .go file fail `gofmt -l`). Committed with the CI introduction.
*.go text eol=lf
# Shell scripts must be LF so a shebang / `bash file` works on Linux runners.
*.sh text eol=lf
